# slider-camera (h8-points-slider): query scale=1. The plane's visible range
# widens to +-19.8 at 1440x900 (the prompt's -10..10 is the 500x400-fixture
# equivalent) and the thumb moves to 191.77px. Behaviour: valuemin -19.8.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query scale=1
wait 500
shot slider-camera
